UnitConcreteVotingRewardsManager::BalanceOfNFTAt
├── when there are no user checkpoints
│   └── it should return zero
└── when there are user checkpoints
    ├── when there is no checkpoint at or before the timestamp
    │   └── it should return zero
    └── when there is a checkpoint at or before the timestamp
        ├── when the stake is permanent
        │   └── it should return the permanent balance
        └── when the stake is not permanent
            ├── when the timestamp matches the checkpoint timestamp
            │   └── it should return the recorded bias
            └── when the timestamp does not match the checkpoint timestamp
                ├── when the stake has expired
                │   └── it should return zero
                └── when the stake has not expired
                    └── it should return the decayed bias based on the veNFT slope
